{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\nphp 8.1.34\nnodejs 22.12.0\n22\n# Local data stores for MantisBT development and the integration test gate.\n#\n# The application itself runs on the host with PHP's built-in web server\n# (see build/local_instance.sh and docs/local-dev.md).\n# Credentials match .github/workflows/mantisbt.yml: user root, password root,\n# database bugtracker. They are for local use only.\n#\n# MantisBT connects to MySQL on port 3306 (the mysqli driver default), so the\n# host port must stay 3306.\n\nname: mantisbt\n\nservices:\n  mysql:\n    image: mysql:8.0\n    environment:\n      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root\n      MYSQL_DATABASE: bugtracker\n    ports:\n      - \"127.0.0.1:3306:3306\"\n    volumes:\n      - mysql-data:/var/lib/mysql\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"mysqladmin\", \"ping\", \"-h\", \"127.0.0.1\", \"-uroot\", \"-proot\"]\n      interval: 2s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 60\n\n  # Optional: start with DB_TYPE=pgsql (see .env.example).\n  pgsql:\n    image: postgres:16\n    profiles: [\"pgsql\"]\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: root\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: root\n      POSTGRES_DB: bugtracker\n    ports:\n      - \"127.0.0.1:5432:5432\"\n    volumes:\n      - pgsql-data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"pg_isready\", \"-U\", \"root\", \"-d\", \"bugtracker\"]\n      interval: 2s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 60\n\nvolumes:\n  mysql-data:\n  pgsql-data:\n# Settings for the local development scripts (build/local_instance.sh,\n# compose.yaml). Copy to .env to override the defaults below.\n#\n# MantisBT itself does not read environment variables for its settings:\n# application settings live in config/config_inc.php (written by the\n# installer, gitignored). See config/config_inc.php.sample for the list\n# (database, crypto_master_salt, SMTP, email addresses).\n#\n# The only environment variable read by the application code is\n# MANTIS_CONFIG_FOLDER (config_defaults_inc.php): an optional path to an\n# alternative config folder, with a trailing slash.\n# MANTIS_CONFIG_FOLDER=\n\n# Host for the PHP built-in web server. Also used as the database host by the\n# installer, so keep it 127.0.0.1 when the database runs in compose.yaml.\nMANTIS_HOST=127.0.0.1\n\n# Port for the PHP built-in web server (CI uses 8080).\nPORT=8989\n\n# ADOdb driver: mysqli (default, compose service \"mysql\")\n# or pgsql (compose service \"pgsql\", profile \"pgsql\").\nDB_TYPE=mysqli\n\n# Database credentials. They match compose.yaml and the CI workflow.\n# Local use only. The installer also creates the MantisBT administrator\n# account with this user name and password.\nDB_NAME=bugtracker\nDB_USER=root\nDB_PASSWORD=root\n[PHP Modules] bcmath bz2 calendar Core ctype curl date dba dom exif FFI fileinfo filter ftp gd gettext gmp hash iconv intl json ldap lexbor libxml mbstring mysqli mysqlnd odbc openssl pcntl pcre PDO pdo_dblib pdo_mysql PDO_ODBC pdo_pgsql pdo_sqlite pgsql Phar posix random readline Reflection session shmop SimpleXML snmp soap sockets sodium SPL sqlite3 standard sysvmsg sysvsem sysvshm tidy tokenizer uri xml xmlreader xmlwriter xsl Zend OPcache zip zlib  [Zend Modules] Zend OPcache  \nphp\nphp@8.5\nasdf not found\nmise not found\nv25.9.0","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BHzxAgeZ1TPNyj94frXjrG"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"991f388f-793d-4f43-9fc1-9e18393f1a00","uuid":"fc96ff29-81dc-4378-841b-aed3b3d224e6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:43:17.679Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\nphp 8.1.34\nnodejs 22.12.0\n22\n# Local data stores for MantisBT development and the integration test gate.\n#\n# The application itself runs on the host with PHP's built-in web server\n# (see build/local_instance.sh and docs/local-dev.md).\n# Credentials match .github/workflows/mantisbt.yml: user root, password root,\n# database bugtracker. They are for local use only.\n#\n# MantisBT connects to